// equivalent is microsoft.channel.name, which takes the value
// "Copilot Studio Test Pane" for test traffic. Treat that exact string as
// UNVERIFIED as an exhaustive test-traffic filter: it is published as a sample
// value, not as a guaranteed enumeration.
