// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// COMPANION C: agent-level telemetry variant
// Agent-level telemetry writes to customEvents, where designMode is a documented
// custom dimension with values True and False. This is the verified, published
// pattern. It only applies if agent-level telemetry is configured in addition to
// the environment-level export.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
